gleampy: Python port of the GLEAM R package
===========================================

This software is a modified version, translated from R into Python, of the R
package "gleam" (GLEAM-X, the R implementation of FAO's Global Livestock
Environmental Assessment Model), https://github.com/un-fao/GLEAM

