Modification notice (AGPL-3.0, section 5(a))
--------------------------------------------
Modified by the GLEAM Python port contributors; date of this notice:
2026-10-08.

The modifications are:

* The R source code of the package, in the state described in
  tools/r_reference/README.md (unreleased development branches of
  un-fao/GLEAM merged together, plus one adaptation of run_emissions_direct()
  dated 2026-10-06), was translated into Python and vectorised. The
  intentional differences from the R code are listed in docs/R_PORT_NOTES.md.
* The example input tables in src/gleampy/data/run_gleam_examples/ and
  src/gleampy/data/run_modules_examples/ are copies of the R package's
  inst/extdata/ files. emissions_direct_input_hrd_data.csv is the version
  modified by that adaptation (two columns added, 2026-10-06).
* src/gleampy/data/parameter_ranges.csv is a copy of the R package's
  data-raw/parameter_ranges.csv with the spaces removed from one line
  (ratio_me_to_ne).

